{
    "title": "Waymo One",
    "description": "Get there with the Waymo Driver \u2014 The World\u2019s Most Experienced Driver\u2122\r\n\r\nThe Waymo One app is making it safer, more accessible, and more sustainable to get around \u2014 without the need for anyone in the driver\u2019s seat.\r\n\r\nToday, anyone can take an autonomous ride with Waymo One in San Francisco or the Metro Phoenix area. In Los Angeles and Austin, download the app and we\u2019ll let you know when it\u2019s your time to ride.\r\n\r\nBuilt with you in mind:\r\n\u2022 Get around safely: The Waymo Driver has driven tens of millions of miles on the road and billions of miles in simulated scenarios. The data to date indicates the Waymo Driver is already reducing traffic injuries and fatalities in the places we currently operate.\r\n\u2022 Stay empowered with our interactive in-car screens: The Waymo Driver knows your local roads and shows you what it\u2019s seeing along the way\u2014every car, pedestrian, cyclist, and more. You\u2019ll see its planned route and stay informed every step of the way. Call Rider Support at any time if you need to talk to a helpful human or pull over if you need to end your ride early.\r\n\u2022 Enjoy your journey: A Waymo car has all the freedom of having your own vehicle without the stresses of driving or maintaining it. Pick the perfect temperature, play your favorite music, catch up with a friend, or simply take a nap. You\u2019ll look forward to every ride.\r\n\r\nHow the Waymo Driver works:\r\n\u2022 The World\u2019s Most Experienced Driver\u2122: Our vehicles are operated by the Waymo Driver, a technology that\u2019s designed to prioritize safety and take the stress out of people\u2019s everyday drives.\r\n\u2022 Multilayered suite of sensors: Our cameras, lidar, and radar work together so the Waymo Driver can see up to three football fields away in all directions, day and night. Safety is our top priority, so the Waymo Driver is trained and tested to carefully navigate in all driving situations and get you to your destination, stress free.\r\n\r\nHow do I get a ride with Waymo One?\r\n\u2022 If you\u2019re in San Francisco/Daly City or Metro Phoenix (Downtown Phoenix, Tempe, Mesa, Scottsdale, Chandler, and the Salt River Pima-Maricopa Indian Community Talking Stick Entertainment District), download the Waymo One app and enter your destination to request a ride.\r\n\u2022 If you\u2019re in Los Angeles or Austin, download the Waymo One app and we\u2019ll reach out when it\u2019s your time to ride.\r\n\u2022 Just hop in the back seat, buckle up, and press the Start Ride button.\r\n\u2022 Sit back and enjoy your trip! Watch the passenger screen to see what the Waymo Driver sees as it takes you to your destination. Our Rider Support team is always available to help when you need it.\r\n\r\nFrom which countries can I download the Waymo One app?\r\nWaymo One is available for download in:\r\n\u2022 US\r\n\u2022 Canada\r\n\u2022 India\r\n\u2022 Japan\r\n\u2022 Singapore\r\n\u2022 Mexico\r\n\u2022 Great Britain (UK)\r\n\u2022 Australia\r\n\u2022 New Zealand",
