g situations and get you to your destination, stress free.<br><br>How do I get a ride with Waymo One?<br>\u2022 If you\u2019re in San Francisco/Daly City or Metro Phoenix (Downtown Phoenix, Tempe, Mesa, Scottsdale, Chandler, and the Salt River Pima-Maricopa Indian Community Talking Stick Entertainment District), download the Waymo One app and enter your destination to request a ride.<br>\u2022 If you\u2019re in Los Angeles or Austin, download the Waymo One app and we\u2019ll reach out when it\u2019s your time to ride.<br>\u2022 Just hop in the back seat, buckle up, and press the Start Ride button.<br>\u2022 Sit back and enjoy your trip! Watch the passenger screen to see what the Waymo Driver sees as it takes you to your destination. Our Rider Support team is always available to help when you need it.<br><br>From which countries can I download the Waymo One app?<br>Waymo One is available for download in:<br>\u2022 US<br>\u2022 Canada<br>\u2022 India<br>\u2022 Japan<br>\u2022 Singapore<br>\u2022 Mexico<br>\u2022 Great Britain (UK)<br>\u2022 Australia<br>\u2022 New Zealand",
